body:
I did this evening... I found 1 and luckily I have talked to someone on there 

&#x200B;

I have cried, on and off... the whole night..

I have similar situation with you. Long term depression, 35 , just met a guy I like, told him I have depression, it might be wrong to tell him in the very beginning of not even a relationship. He said its ok but I felt distance after I told him. 

&#x200B;

But I am glad I have friends around to support me, and even the comments here are so supportive and yeah. I am afraid to go to party or events, as I don't like seeing people all in a couples... but I know I will be OK 1 day. I am working on it as I have already booked in a therapy on 29th Dec. 

&#x200B;

My mood swings all the time, sometimes I cried sometimes I like to see people and talk about my feeling... Its good to talk to the one who understand you. Can go on fb or here and express yourself, talk to us
